{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Carnival Phantasm","The Carnival Moment is a time when several narratives from Type-Moon's famous works intersect. It happens every decade in an entirely new dimension, and those who have never run into each other can meet. And what's more, all individuals involved gain the opportunity to fulfill any of their wishes! However, they will have to come a long way, as they will need to partake in contests.\n\n\n\nIn Carnival Phantasm, various characters are put into situations that ridicule their own worlds. Nevertheless, they all have the same objective: to win the contests by any means necessary!\n\n\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)\n\n\n\nNote: Adaptation of the \"Take Moon\" manga series by Type-Moon's Eri Takenashi, created to celebrate Type-Moon's 10th anniversary. It features parodies and new stories loosely based on Type-Moon's original works, including Fate/stay night, Tsukihime, Melty Blood, and more."],"ja":["カーニバル・ファンタズム",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-10012","ids":{"shikimori":10012,"mal":10012,"anilist":10012,"kodik":"serial-55171"},"kodikIds":["serial-25586","serial-6199","serial-17083","serial-55171"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-25586":"2020-05-10T07:25:51Z","serial-6199":"2019-12-03T07:33:15Z","serial-17083":"2020-02-09T16:27:27Z","serial-55171":"2024-03-28T14:52:36Z"},"title":"Карнавальный фантазм","originalTitle":"Carnival Phantasm","alt":"カーニバル・ファンタズム","description":"Адаптация манги « Тейк Мун », придуманной Эри Такэнаси . Представляет собой набор пародий на работы студии Type-Moon , такие как « Судьба/Ночь схватки », « Повесть о лунной принцессе », « Талая кровь » и др. Знакомые нам персонажи предстают перед нами в весьма неожиданных и смешных амплуа, иронизируют над ошибками оригиналов, словом, делают всё то, что и должны делать персонажи добротной, качественной комедии.","year":2011,"type":"OVA","genres":["Комедия","Сверхъестественное","пародия"],"rating":7.87,"popularity":0,"ongoing":false,"r